  },
  {
    "topic": "H06",
    "line": 36,
    "chunk_id": "L6",
    "human_operation": "REACTION",
    "text": "あるやん。",
    "dominant_color": "E",
    "color_counts": {
      "F": 0,
      "E": 5,
      "T": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "topic": "H06",
    "line": 37,
    "chunk_id": "L6",
    "human_operation": "APPRAISAL",
    "text": "景品は普通にいっぱいあるのにさ、出ねえの。",
    "dominant_color": "F",
    "color_counts": {
      "F": 18,
      "E": 3,
      "T": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "topic": "H06",
    "line": 38,
    "chunk_id": "L6",
    "human_operation": "REACTION",
    "text": "もうさ、くれよ。",
    "dominant_color": "E",
    "color_counts": {
      "F": 0,
      "E": 8,
      "T": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "topic": "H06",
    "line": 39,
    "chunk_id": "L6",
    "human_operation": "REACTION",
    "text": "これはマジでちょっとね、ああってなりました。",
    "dominant_color": "E",
    "color_counts": {
      "F": 0,
      "E": 22,
      "T": 0
    }
  },
  {
    "topic": "H06",
    "line": 40,
    "chunk_id": "L7",
    "human_operation": "INFERENCE",
    "text": "9000円あれば普通に1個買えるだろ。",
    "dominant_color": "T",
    "color_counts": {
      "F": 0,
      "E": 0,
      "T": 19
